<https://culturalcartography.net/names/john-edmonstone/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "John Edmonstone" ;
    dcterms:description "Edmonstone taught the 16-year-old Darwin taxidermy skills. He also told Darwin about his experiences of slavery (he was a freed slave; Darwin was a lifelong opponent of slavery), and about the tropical rain-forest in Guyana. (Note: Darwin never named Edmonstone in writing, but there seems no doubt of the identification.)"@en ;
