<https://culturalcartography.net/names/christian-gottlob-neefe/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Christian Gottlob Neefe" ;
    dcterms:description "Neefe followed Hiller as kapellmeister with a travelling theatre. He was the 12-year-old Beethoven's first real teacher of music: they remained friends for many years. Reicha played alongside Neefe and Beethoven in Reicha's uncle's orchestra, and may also have been taught by Neefe."@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.classicfm.com/composers/beethoven/guides/gottlob-neefe-1748-1798-beethovens-first-teacher/>,
