<https://culturalcartography.net/names/jean-baptiste-rousseau/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Jean-Baptiste Rousseau" ;
    dcterms:description "Boileau encouraged the young Rousseau to write. Voltaire met him in Brussels: they were mutually and violently antagonistic, Voltaire later compounding the matter by publishing a vindictive biography of Rousseau. Montagu met and corresponded with him, and Piron was a friend."@en ;
