<https://culturalcartography.net/names/gianni-vattimo/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Gianni Vattimo" ;
    dcterms:description "Pareyson taught Vattimo, and his fellow-student Eco: Vattimo later succeeded Pareyson in his professorship. Gadamer also taught him, at least as influentially, in Heidelberg. Derrida collaborated with him on questions of religion; so, separately, did Rorty."@en ;
