<https://culturalcartography.net/names/quentin-de-la-tour/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Quentin de La Tour" ;
    dcterms:description "Chardin was one of the artist friends La Tour made portraits of. The philosophes Rousseau, d'Alembert and Voltaire were among his best friends; Diderot considered asking him to contribute to his and d'Alembert's Encyclopédie."@en ;
