<https://culturalcartography.net/names/daniel-draper/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Daniel Draper" ;
    dcterms:description "Abbe, Bell, Tyndall, Cattell, Eiffel and Piazzi Smyth were all scientific correspondents of Draper's. He assisted his father John W. Draper with lectures at New York University, and was involved in the establishment of his brother Henry's astronomical observatory."@en ;
