<https://culturalcartography.net/names/vicente-martin-y-soler/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Vicente Martín y Soler" ;
    dcterms:description "Martín y Soler was taught by Martini. Da Ponte collaborated with him in Vienna, and again — after having to flee Vienna on 24 hours' notice — in London. He knew Haydn, Salieri, Mozart and Kelly from his time as one of three court composers in Vienna."@en ;
