<https://culturalcartography.net/names/carl-czerny/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Carl Czerny" ;
    dcterms:description "Czerny studied under Beethoven, Hummel, Salieri and Albrechtsberger. Chopin and he were admirers of each other's work, and visited and corresponded frequently. Clementi was a colleague, and Thalberg, Liszt and Heller were among his pupils. Field visited him in Vienna, probably only once."@en ;
