<https://culturalcartography.net/names/johann-georg-albrechtsberger/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Johann Georg Albrechtsberger" ;
    dcterms:description "Albrechtsberger was among composers sought out by Kraus on a long visit to Vienna in 1783. Michael Haydn had been a fellow-student, and both Haydn brothers were friends of Albrechtsberger, as also was Mozart, of whom he was very fond. Hummel, Czerny, Moscheles, Weigl and Beethoven were among his pupils."@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://www.allmusic.com/artist/johann-georg-albrechtsberger-mn0001513859/biography>,
