<https://culturalcartography.net/names/raymond-duchamp-villon/#person> a foaf:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Raymond Duchamp-Villon" ;
    dcterms:description "A significant sculptor who died prematurely. Duchamp and Villon were his brothers, and fellow-organisers of the Puteaux group, a Sunday discussion group for artists including the painters Picabia, Gris, Léger, Delaunay, Gleizes, Metzinger and Kupka, and the sculptor Archipenko. Boccioni was a personal friend and almost certainly an influence on his sculptural work. Villon shared the same house; Kupka lived next door."@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://oxfordindex.oup.com/view/10.1093/oi/authority.20110803095733204>,
        <https://www.artnet.com/artists/raymond-duchamp-villon/biography> ;
