    dcterms:description "Alechinsky joined Dotremont, Appel and Jorn in the newly-founded CoBrA group in 1949. He studied engraving with Hayter, collaborated with Ting and Bury, and made a connection with Breton. Brauner, Giacometti and van Velde all became friends."@en ;
